<title>USA: Chrysler October US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Chrysler October US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp</p>
<p>			Oct 1-31, 1996     Oct 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    61,213	    52,222	    +12.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 144,180	   113,487	    +22.3</p>
<p> Import Car		     0	     1,114	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Oct 31, 1996 Jan 1-Oct 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   718,238	   659,276	     +8.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,368,464	 1,136,874	    +19.4</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,692	    13,317	    -65.0</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 27 in latest month vs 26, 258 for year to date vs 256 in year ago.</p>
</text>
